# Local-dev curated battlefield art. Drop a PNG here named exactly
# `<scene>.png` (e.g. deadline_dungeon.png, cubicle_forest.png) and
# vite dev will serve it under `/dev-battlefield/<scene>.png`.
# CombatHexGrid probes that URL first and uses it instead of the
# Flux/R2 image whenever it's present.
#
# Promote a curated drop to prod by uploading to R2 via wrangler — see
# docs/curated-battlefield-art.md.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
!.gitignore
!README.md
